[0.000007,"o","\u001b[1;34m          The script records who worked a shift and which starship they commanded\u001b[0m"]
[0.000034,"o","                                       \u001b[1;34m        Steps\u001b[0m"]
[0.000262,"o","                                                                                                           \u001b[1;34m          1. Create a new script from scratch and make it executable\u001b[0m                                                    \u001b[1;34m          2. Take the technician name as an argument\u001b[0m                                                                    \u001b[1;34m          3. Read the starship name from stdin\u001b[0m                                                                          \u001b[1;34m          4. Supply that input from a file instead of the keyboard\u001b[0m                                                      \u001b[1;34m          5. Add a value produced by another command\u001b[0m"]
